This project analyzes a simulated IT employee dataset using MySQL to uncover insights about salary distribution, gender comparison, and the relationship between experience, position, and compensation levels.

The dataset contains 400 employee records with details such as gender, experience, job position, and salary.

The goal is to perform exploratory data analysis using SQL to understand salary patterns and workforce structure in the IT industry.

🛠️ Tools Used
MySQL
SQL (Aggregation, Filtering, Grouping, Subqueries, Window Functions)
Employee Dataset (Simulated IT Industry Data)
